WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.901
-Thank you very much!

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.936
And welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.138
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:07.206
[ Cheering and applause ]
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.140
thank you for watching.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.375
Thank you for being here.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.778
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:14.580
Well, guys, we have
some good news from overseas

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.649
in the fight against COVID.
Watch this.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.185 line:0%
-The UK approved
the Pfizer vaccine.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.455 line:0%
It makes the UK
the first Western country

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:26.159 line:0%
to give a vaccine to the public
outside of trials.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.626
-Wow!
Everyone there

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:30.229
will have access
to the Pfizer vaccine.

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:32.999
Apparently, the UK is now
five hours

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.833
and five months ahead of us.

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:36.269
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.970
Americans heard and were like,

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:38.871
"I watch 'The Crown.'

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.073
Does that mean I can get it?"

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.507
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:43.042
The news is so good,
people in UK

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.744
got this close
to showing emotion.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.145
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:48.214
[ English accent ]
I feel a tear coming on.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:49.548
Fight it!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:50.683
Fight it!

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.819
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.553
But this is interesting --
there's an order

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:57.023
for who gets the vaccine first.
It goes

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.391
codgers, hags, blokes, mums,
and, last,

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.293
[ English accent ] wankers.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:02.762
That was interesting.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.130
These are some strange times.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.231
Right, now Americans are looking

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.000
at leader of the UK
and thinking,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.102
"I wish we had that guy
in charge."

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.469
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:11.604
The vaccine over there

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.473
is actually the same
as American one.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.175
The only difference is
the British one

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.910
is drier and more sarcastic.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.980
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.049
I love that joke.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.517
Meanwhile, I saw that
Vladimir Putin said Russia

00:01:25.517 --> 00:01:28.855
will also start vaccinating
their people next week.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.756
Yeah, the vaccine seems
like a winner.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:33.192
5 out of 5 Russian doctors
recommend it.

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:34.594
[ Slavic accent ]
If they know
what's good for them.

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:36.562
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:38.031
And this is great --
Russia's already working

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:39.766
on a vaccine for whatever is

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.833
in that vaccine.

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:45.171
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.007
Seriously, I'd eat sushi
in Iowa on a Tuesday

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.577
before I'd trust
a vaccine in Russia.

00:01:50.577 --> 00:01:52.111
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:54.080
Hey, some big news
from Washington.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.981
Yesterday, it came out
that President Trump

00:01:55.981 --> 00:01:58.817
might give Rudy Giuliani
a preemptive pardon.

00:01:58.817 --> 00:02:00.953
Well, now, he's thinking
about the same thing

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:03.522
for his son-in-law,
Jared Kushner;

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:07.359
and his kids Ivanka,
Eric, and Don Jr.

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:09.462
Some families get each other
sweaters for Christmas.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.897
The Trumps get pardons.

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.164
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.164 --> 00:02:13.499
Yep, Trump said he wants
to focus

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.334
on taking care
of his loved ones,

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:16.669
those closest to him,

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:17.804
and Eric.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:22.075
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:23.843
It's not a great look
for your presidency

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.411
when your biggest
accomplishment is

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.846
"Most Family Members Pardoned."

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.280
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.548
It's pretty crazy.
The last person

00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:31.550
who needed pardons
for whole family

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.518
was Charles Manson.

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:34.520
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.723
-Meanwhile, Mike Pence
is also asking for a pardon,

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:38.391
for the time
he accidentally glanced

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:39.759
at a picture of Kate Upton.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:43.396
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:44.963
[ Drums play ]
Mother!

00:02:44.963 --> 00:02:47.066
It happened!
It happened again!

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.735
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:53.106
It was scary for me,
but I slept it off.

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:59.946
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.214
Face-down on the couch.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.348
-Yeah.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:03.616
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:06.285
That's right, everybody,
Trump is busy.

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:10.556
Last night he hosted
a White House Christmas party.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:11.957
He hosted a party.

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:13.993
And he made a pretty big
announcement. Listen to this.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.263 line:0%
-Overnight, President Trump
touting his success,

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:19.798 line:0%
hinting at the inevitable,
and suggesting

00:03:19.798 --> 00:03:22.135 line:0%
another possible run
for the White House.

00:03:30.142 --> 00:03:31.511
-Melania heard that
and was like,

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:33.279
if you think I'm decorating
this stupid house again,

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.347
you're nuts!"

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:35.581
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:36.949
Really,
another Trump presidency?

00:03:36.949 --> 00:03:39.719
That's like the director
of "Cats" announcing a sequel.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:41.521
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.289
You can tell Trump's serious
about running again

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:46.392
because already claiming
the 2024 election is rigged.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:47.827
[ Isolated laughs ]
If Trump --

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:48.895
Thank you, Seth.

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:51.197
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.498
Always count on you, buddy.

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:54.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:57.503
If Trump won in 2024,
he'd be the first president

00:03:57.503 --> 00:04:01.140
to serve nonconsecutive terms
since Grover Cleveland,

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.841
which Trump thinks is
the full name

00:04:02.841 --> 00:04:04.110
of the fuzzy blue Muppet.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:10.650
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.418
That's right, in four years,
Trump's either going to be

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:13.586
the president
of the United States

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:16.055
or the cohost
of "American Ninja Warrior."

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.390
[ Laughter ]
But there was actually

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.659
another video taken
of Trump's big announcement.

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:20.793
I don't know
if you've seen this thing.

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.061
Listen to this.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:28.268 line:0%
-[ Coughing ]

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:33.306 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:34.373
[ Coughing ]

00:04:34.373 --> 00:04:35.508
-Ew!

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:38.310
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:42.114
-Ugh! A party without masks,
people coughing everywhere.

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:44.416
Next, Trump's going to celebrate
the eight nights of Hanukkah

00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:45.618
at Walter Reed.

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.453
[ Laughter ]

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:49.555
Well, guys, earlier tonight,
NBC aired the

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:53.025
88th Annual Rockefeller Center
Christmas Tree Lighting

00:04:53.025 --> 00:04:55.628
and I have to say
the tree looks amazing.

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:58.330
It's somewhere between 75
and 80 years old

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.566
and good news -- at that age,
the tree will be one

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:02.335
of the first
to receive the vaccine.

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:04.404
[ Laughter ]

00:05:04.404 --> 00:05:06.105
If you plan on seeing
the tree in person,

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:09.308
it'll stay lit every day
from 6:00 am to midnight,

00:05:09.308 --> 00:05:11.611
pretty much like every parent
homeschooling their kids.

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:13.312
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.312 --> 00:05:15.414
But, due to COVID,
visitors can only see the tree

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:16.782
for five minutes.

00:05:16.782 --> 00:05:18.417
In response, Dads were like --

00:05:18.417 --> 00:05:19.551
[ Changes accent ]
What are we supposed to do

00:05:19.551 --> 00:05:21.053
with the other four
and a half minutes?

00:05:21.053 --> 00:05:25.324
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.324 --> 00:05:26.391
See it?

00:05:26.391 --> 00:05:27.393
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:27.393 --> 00:05:29.095
Oh, thank you.
Wow, applause?

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:30.896
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.896 --> 00:05:33.098
Some business news --
I heard that Drake

00:05:33.098 --> 00:05:36.301
is now selling a scented candle
that smells like

00:05:36.301 --> 00:05:37.203
himself.

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:38.838
[ Laughter ]

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.873
Imagine being a scientist
and your boss is like,

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:42.408
"I'm pulling you
off the COVID vaccine

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:44.310
so you can work
on the Drake candle."

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.545
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.545 --> 00:05:48.347
Actually, Drake said it's not
even pronounced "Drake."

00:05:48.347 --> 00:05:49.849
It's pronounced "Drah-ké."

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:51.884
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:53.052
-Ew!

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:54.487
-That's right,
the Drake candle smells like

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:58.023
musk, ambers, cashmere,
suede, and velvet.

00:05:58.023 --> 00:06:00.092
I, on the other hand,
smell like Speed Stick,

00:06:00.092 --> 00:06:01.694
everything bagels, and Purell.

